<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25805" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασεύομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dart through,</i> used by <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in 3sg.
			
				Ep.
			
			aor.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέσσῠτο,</span> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφροιο δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.194
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμὴ δὲ στέρνοιο δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.542
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ μεγάροιο δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.37
				</span></i>
			: less freq. c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. λαὸν Ἀχαιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.450
				</span></i>
			: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμὴ δὲ δ. [μηροῦ</span>
			or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηρόν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				5.661
			</span></i>: later in part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεσσύμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					3.641
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέσσυται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					2.259
				</span></i>
			.</div>
